  button: ITALIA
  subtitle: PARMIGIANO / TOWER / OLIVE OIL / PEPERONCINO / PIZZA / POMODORI
  intro: Six souvenirs of one country. Fill the map with their shadows.
  hint: The tower leans down the peninsula. The chili is the toe, the bottle the
    heel, and a slice of pizza is an island.
  complete: 'ITALIA

    Cheese in the north, a leaning tower down the middle,

    peperoncino
    in the toe and pizza by the sea.'
